---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site, localBusinessSchema } from '../../config/site';

const procedureSchema = {
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "MedicalProcedure",
  "name": "Adult Dentistry Services Available at Bear Creek Family Dentistry",
  "description": "Keep the whole family smiling with adult dentistry services including dental checkups and periodontal therapy from Bear Creek Family Dentistry.",
  "procedureType": "https://schema.org/Therapeutic",
  "provider": {
    "@type": "Dentist",
    "name": "Bear Creek Family Dentistry",
    "address": {
      "@type": "PostalAddress",
      "addressLocality": "Dallas"
    }
  }
};
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Adult Dentistry Dallas | ${site.name}`}
  description="Keep the whole family smiling with adult dentistry services including dental checkups and periodontal therapy from Bear Creek Family Dentistry."
  schema={[localBusinessSchema, procedureSchema]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16 md:py-24">
    <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary mb-4">
      <a href="/services" class="hover:underline">Services</a>
    </p>
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-neutral-dark mb-4 leading-tight">
      Adult Dentistry Services Available at Bear Creek Family Dentistry
    </h1>
    <p class="text-xl text-neutral-mid mb-8 leading-relaxed">
      Keep the whole family smiling with adult dentistry services including dental checkups and periodontal therapy from Bear Creek Family Dentistry.
    </p>
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed">
      <p class="mb-4">Because of our kid-friendly decor, many patients think Bear Creek Family Dentistry is just for children. We have great news for adults looking for family-friendly dentistry services in the DFW Metroplex. Unlike other general dentistry offices, a family dentist makes caring for oral health at every age and stage of development easier. All your dental care needs are met under one roof, so you don't have to travel from office to office. Because we have a team of experts who offer treatment for patients at all stages of dental development, you can receive all your necessary dental services under one roof. Our team focuses on prevention, early detection, and comprehensive treatment to help you maintain a healthy smile for life.</p>
      
    </div>
    <div class="mt-10 flex gap-4 flex-wrap">
      <a href="/schedule" class="btn-primary">Book Your Visit</a>
      <a href="/services" class="btn-secondary">View All Services</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pb-16 md:pb-24">
    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none text-neutral-mid leading-relaxed space-y-4">
      <p>Dental checkups are encouraged for most adults at least twice a year.</p>
      <p>During appointments, team examines current state of oral health, screens for early indicators of issues, provides professional cleanings, and creates a personalized treatment plan.</p>
      <p>Services include restorative dentistry (dental crowns, bridges, root canals), dental implant supported tooth replacement, specialty services (orthodontics, oral surgery, periodontal therapy), and emergency dentistry.</p>
      <p>Block scheduling is available to see entire family on one day.</p>
      <p>Board Certified specialists in Oral Surgery, Prosthodontics, Orthodontics, and Pediatric Dentistry available in-house.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
